{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1455061-creating-creatures-for-birthrights","id":1455061,"title":"Creating creatures for birthrights","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-07-16T19:37:37-07:00","id":1455061,"title":"Creating creatures for birthrights","content":"Couple of questions<br /> <br /> Primary, secondary and desperation pool amounts. Hero tells us that the primary pool is dot rating times three, but I can't find anywhere what the secondary and desperation pool amount should be. The examples given don't seem to follow any rule that I could figure out.<br /> <br /> Costs for Sorcery. If they created a phoenix it mention in Sorcery it costs 1 tension to channel that purview for fire boons. Does the party pay that momentum cost instead? Would it have it's own momentum pool?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26928-brutyl","name":"brutyl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-17T11:16:18-07:00","id":1455082,"title":"","content":"I copied the example basilisk and made the secondary and desperation pools (primary -2) and (primary -4).<br /> Yes, spend momentum from the group pool rather than tension.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26642-notmidas","name":"notMidas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-18T01:30:58-07:00","id":1455096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brutyl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1455061-creating-creatures-for-birthrights#post1455061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Couple of questions<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Costs for Sorcery. If they created a phoenix it mention in Sorcery it costs 1 tension to channel that purview for fire boons. Does the party pay that momentum cost instead? Would it have it's own momentum pool?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure what you mean by Sorcery, i checked in every book but didn't saw an option for a Creature to let you channel a purview, is there something i am missing ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12946-emerick","name":"Emerick","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12946_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T05:33:51-07:00","id":1455188,"title":"","content":"Isn't the Secondary pool half of the Primary pool, and the Desperation pool half of the Secondary?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T07:46:13-07:00","id":1455195,"title":"","content":"I cribbed this from somewhere else on the forum awhile back and have it on my roll20 game forum because I was tired of hunting down the post. My apologies to whoever came up with this, i wish I remembered your name!<br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Primary Pool</b>: Creature dots x 3, list 2 or 3 things the Creature is best at</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Secondary Pool</b>: Primary -2, list 1 or 2 things the Creature is ok at</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Desperation Pool</b>: Primary -4</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Initiative: </b>Desperation or Secondary, depending on the focus of the Creature.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Health</b>: Creature dots</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Defense</b>: Creature/2 (rounded up)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Tricks/Commands</b>: Knows a number of tricks or commands equal to Creature dots (I've treated communication and carrying people as tricks)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Qualities</b>: Whatever makes sense for the Creature, within reason. (Especially powerful Qualities should probably be treated like Flairs in terms of reducing the Primary dice pool. For animal senses and such just give them Scale 1 on those rolls)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b>Flairs</b>: You can add a Flair to a Creature by reducing it's Primary pool by 2 dice. If a Flair costs Tension to use, spend Momentum instead.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T07:49:27-07:00","id":1455196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Florin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1455061-creating-creatures-for-birthrights?p=1455188#post1455188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't the Secondary pool half of the Primary pool, and the Desperation pool half of the Secondary?</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. That is indeed not how antagonists are built in Scion. That must be for TC then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-19T07:51:37-07:00","id":1455197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brutyl</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1455061-creating-creatures-for-birthrights#post1455061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Costs for Sorcery. If they created a phoenix it mention in Sorcery it costs 1 tension to channel that purview for fire boons. Does the party pay that momentum cost instead? Would it have it's own momentum pool?</div> </div> </div> </div>If a Creature ability says to spend Tension you are correct, spend Momentum instead. There is just one pool of momentum for players and their companions to draw from. The assumption for Creatures if they're mostly doing things at the command of the player they're attached to. If the Phoenix is intelligent and self-willed you could represent it as a Follower or Guide instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4270,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","user":"literatzi","date":". 07-19-2021, 03:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-17T10:21:00-07:00","id":1457034,"title":"","content":"Why is all this not in the creature section of the book are they going to put out a free book to fix this....key word free book because it appears to be a mistake on their part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-17T12:39:32-07:00","id":1457044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1455061-creating-creatures-for-birthrights?p=1457034#post1457034\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why is all this not in the creature section of the book are they going to put out a free book to fix this....key word free book because it appears to be a mistake on their part.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Text box at the bottom of page 202 in Hero, in the Creature section.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}